--- !u!114 &11400110
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Welcome_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  nodeId: guide_welcome_1
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "지금 할 일은 나침반이 알려 줘. 외곽 신호가 남아 있으면 수호자부터."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_welcome_2
  trueNextNodeId:
  falseNextNodeId:
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 620, y: 520}
--- !u!114 &11400111
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Welcome_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_welcome_2
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "Bokusei"
  dialogueText: "수호자 셋을 쓰러뜨리면 중앙 신호가 나타나고, 평가를 끝내면 귀환 포털이 열려."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_welcome_3
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 900, y: 520}
--- !u!114 &11400112
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Welcome_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_welcome_3
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "맞아. 그리고 작전 이야기는 돌아올 때까지 아껴 둬. 그게 이 마을의 오래된 규칙이야."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_end
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 1180, y: 520}
--- !u!114 &11400120
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Secret_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_secret_1
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "쉿. 이번 나침반에서 달라진 표식은 지도에만 표시해. 밖에서 말하면 다음 원정에 바로 써먹을 테니까."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_secret_2
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 620, y: 260}
--- !u!114 &11400121
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Secret_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_secret_2
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "Bokusei"
  dialogueText: "밖에서는 공식 안내만, 작전은 여기서만. 이제 알겠어."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_secret_3
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 900, y: 260}
--- !u!114 &11400122
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Secret_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_secret_3
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "정답. 정해 둔 순서보다 눈앞의 표식을 믿어. 무사히 돌아오면 기록은 내가 맞춰 볼게."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_end
  trueNextNodeId:
  falseNextNodeId:
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 1180, y: 260}
